@startuml State_Outbound
title State Machine — Outbound Document (SM-02, Provisional)

' OBJECT  : SMO-02 Inventory Transaction Document — Outbound
' UC      : UC-17 Buat Draft outbound lengkap; UC-18 Post outbound
' FR      : FR-OUT-001, FR-OUT-002, FR-OUT-003, FR-OUT-004, FR-OUT-005, FR-OUT-006, FR-AUD-004, FR-AUD-001
' RULE    : RULE-003, RULE-004, RULE-007, RULE-008, RULE-009, RULE-010, RULE-011, RULE-014, RULE-018, RULE-024, RULE-025, RULE-027
' DECISION: D-B03 Proposed, D-B07 Proposed, D-B15 Proposed, D-T06 Proposed
' CATATAN : Negative stock dilarang. Hak posting WO tidak final (UD-03 unresolved reference).

state "Draft" as Draft
state "Posted" as Posted

[*] --> Draft : Create [UC-17, nomor unik, master aktif] / simpan baris dan serial tersedia, saldo tetap

Draft --> Draft : Revise [masih Draft] / simpan ulang baris, saldo tetap

Draft --> Posted : Post [UC-18, permission, serial tersedia, kuantitas tidak melebihi saldo, masih Draft] / transaksi kurangi saldo asal, movement OUTBOUND, audit, COMMIT

Draft --> Draft : Post gagal [saldo kurang, serial invalid, tanpa permission, atau error] / ROLLBACK penuh, tolak tanpa negative stock

Posted --> Posted : Edit/Hapus [RULE-012] / tolak, dokumen utuh

Posted --> [*]

note right of Draft
  RULE-010: Draft tidak mengurangi saldo.
  Hak posting WO default tidak (BRA 12).
end note

note right of Posted
  RULE-014: saldo asal berkurang.
  Immutable; koreksi lewat SM-05.
end note

@enduml
